<title>HONG KONG: Shandong Xinhua debuts at HK$2.20/share.</title>
<headline>Shandong Xinhua debuts at HK$2.20/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>China-incorporated medicine maker Shandong Xinhua Pharmaceutical Co Ltd's H-shares made their trading debut on the Hong Kong stock market on Tuesday at HK$2.20 per share, compared with their issue price of HK$1.82.</p>
</text>
